msgctxt "260"
msgid "Are you Sawako Usami?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Yes. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"I'm looking into the murder that happened at Café Alps\r\n"
"six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "There's nothing left to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Yuichi Akechi might not have killed Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"If we're gonna find out the truth, I need to hear your\r\n"
"account of what happened that day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You were there when Akechi confronted Oda, weren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I mean, I was the reason they fought, so of course\r\n"
"I was there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "What happened after that? Did you see Akechi kill Oda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "I took off, so don't ask me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Took off? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Do you have any idea what it feels like to have your\r\n"
"significant other walk in on you when you're with someone\r\n"
"else? Talk about awkward...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"And it would've been even more awkward if other people\r\n"
"started coming in to see what the fuss was all about...\r\n"
"So I ran out the back door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "What did you do after you left the café?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"I went home... but Yuichi followed me. We spent the\r\n"
"night arguing about breaking up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Of course, I never imagined he'd already killed Oda-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "So, you're saying you didn't see Akechi kill Oda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "That's right. And I told the police that, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"(So <Color:7>nobody actually saw Akechi kill Oda<Color:Default>, huh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Usami's Testimony<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Tell me about the person seen fleeing the scene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"I don't know anything about that. I left the café before\r\n"
"Yuichi did, so I don't know how he left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Weren't there, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like I ought to ask for more details about Usami's\r\n"
"alibi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Tell me about the person seen fleeing the scene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"I don't know anything about that. I left the café before\r\n"
"Yuichi did, so I don't know how he left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Right. Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Any idea why somebody would kill Oda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Are you trying to be funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "No, I mean... besides your relationship with Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Did he do anything to make anybody else mad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"I don't know. The police would've known if he had any loans\r\n"
"out or anything like that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I wasn't particularly close to him, really. We just ended\r\n"
"up hooking up that night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"(Maybe Akechi really <Italic>did</Italic> kill Oda after seeing him with\r\n"
"Usami...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"They didn't find your fingerprints on the murder weapon,\r\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"Right. They only found Yuichi's. We constantly replaced\r\n"
"the customers' ashtrays with clean ones, but Yuichi must\r\n"
"have been the only one to touch that one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "I guess he was just unlucky..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"Yuichi took good care of the customers and replaced their\r\n"
"ashtrays often. I think he must've noticed that one was\r\n"
"chipped..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Are we through here? I'm supposed to be working."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Right. Sorry. Thanks for the help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"I wanna ask you more about the day of the murder, if\r\n"
"you don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
